            <description>&lt;p&gt;MSFS 2024 1.9.24 compatibility. After updating the application, select Settings → Updates → Preview and install runtime 2026.11.05-dev10-preview1 with Update.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Startup and mission-guard mappings are validated; one Charles de Gaulle takeoff is confirmed on M1 Pro with 32 GB. All 42 owned helper controls pass.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An earlier initial-loading 6% freeze required an isolated Steam/Wine restart. Long-flight and repeated-launch reliability remain unverified. Stable remains 0.1.7.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
